eview_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4177030-1827626365768643","game_id":"steam-4177030","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #7 – Our Giant 50-Movie Archive is Ready! 🎬🍿","summary":"Hello popcorn masters! 🍿✨Today, we are proud to share a massive milestone for Cinema Business Simulator with you. After weeks of hard work, we have officially completed our game's movie library, which now consists of exactly 50 different and original movies ready to grace your cinema's silver screen!A Movie for Every Audience 🎥Running a cinema isn't just about popping corn; it's also about offering the right movie to the right audience. While designing our extensive 50-movie archive, we placed g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-25T16:56:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365768643","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4177030-1826992588601107","game_id":"steam-4177030","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #6: Meet the Popcorn Gun! - Protect Your Empire! 🍿🔫","summary":"Hello, Cinema Owners! 🎬In Cinema Business Simulator, you aren’t just selling popcorn anymore—you’re firing it! Your success has made rivals jealous, and things are starting to get messy. Meet your new best friend for keeping the peace: The Popcorn Gun!🍿 The Popcorn Gun: The Taste of Justice!No real bullets, no blood, no violence! Just high-velocity kernels and a whole lot of \"stunning.\" With this custom-made tool, you can:Stun aggressive drunks who attack your staff at the market area and leave ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-16T10:38:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588601107","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4177030-1825727806717694","game_id":"steam-4177030","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #5: Meet the Core Crew of Your Cinema Empire! 🎬🍿","summary":"Welcome back, cinema owners!Running a successful theater in Cinema Business Simulator takes more than just showing great movies; it takes a dedicated, hard-working team operating behind the scenes. Today, we are thrilled to introduce the 4 pillars of your daily business. Let's meet the crew that will keep your cinema running!👔 The Cashier The face of your business! They handle ticket sales and quickly scan customer purchases. A fast and efficient cashier is essential to keep the lines moving and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-02T14:46:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806717694","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4177030-1819386365097598","game_id":"steam-4177030","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #4 – Inflation System & Fireplace","summary":"Hey, popcorn masters! 🍿📈🔥In this Devlog, we’re adding more depth to your cinema economy and more warmth to your waiting areas.📈 Inflation SystemPrices are no longer static. With the new Inflation System, some products can gain or lose value over time, meaning you’ll need to track the market and adjust your prices to stay profitable. 🔥 FireplaceMake your waiting areas feel cozier and more welcoming with fireplaces that add atmosphere and warmth to your cinema.🛠 ImprovementsWe’ve also included sev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-20T08:10:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365097598","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4177030-1818118366179149","game_id":"steam-4177030","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #3 – Popcorn Masters: Light Up Your Cinema","summary":"Hey, popcorn masters! 🍿✨In this Devlog, we’re giving you a new way to make your cinema feel truly yours: a fully customizable glowing nameboard system.You can now change the color of your cinema’s 3D letters, tweak the glow intensity, and pick different emission colors using an in-game color picker. Whether you want a warm cozy vibe, a bold neon look, or something in between, you can shape the front of your cinema to match your own style.This is just the first step for our customization tools. I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-06T14:35:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366179149","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4177030-1817483467035133","game_id":"steam-4177030","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2 – Say Hello to Our First Cashiers","summary":"Hey, popcorn champions! ːsteamhappyːIn this Devlog, we’re excited to introduce one of the most important roles in any cinema: cashiers.You can now hire employees to work behind the counter, sell tickets and snacks, and keep the line moving while you focus on growing your cinema empire.This is just the beginning of our staff system. In future updates, we plan to expand employee roles and behaviors even further, so your cinema will feel more alive with every new feature.As always, thank you for fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-26T22:40:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467035133","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4177030-1816849002016070","game_id":"steam-4177030","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1 – Our Store Header Got a Makeover","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome to the first DevLog post for Cinema Business Simulator!In this DevLog series, we’ll be sharing upcoming features and notes from the development process with you.We’ve decided to update the capsule art on our Steam page with a new image that we feel represents the spirit of the game more effectively. We hope you like the new artwork – please let us know what you think.Your feedback and comments are incredibly valuable to us, and we hope you’ll continue to join us on th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-22T03:09:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002016070","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4177030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:47:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:47:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4177030":"2026-10-26T01:47:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4177030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:47:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:47:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5347380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:47:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:47:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4177030","app_id":4177030,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d06e8a29a4c7785306a0996aefc84184e8ad3ce0484a6496ebd968ceb0d72702","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Cinema Business Simulat